        "original_id": "67d2c029-0f32-5d3f-9ba1-13e31e9b8e01",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rosi Golan, Lena Meyer-Landrut, Jennifer Braun, Mayaeni Strauss, Per Kristian Ottestad\n- Songs: \"Bee\"\n- Brands: Chicco\n- Companies: Artsana\n- TV Shows: \"Vampire Diaries\", \"Grey's Anatomy\", \"Private Practice\", \"Brothers & Sisters\", \"One Tree Hill\", \"Ghost Whisperer\"\n- Films: \"Dear John\", \"Tiger Eyes\"\n- Retailers and Advertisers: Pantene, J. C. Penney, Walmart\n\nFacts:\n- Chicco is a brand of Artsana.\n- Artsana has worked in the field of children's products for over 50 years, and Chicco is present in more than 120 countries.\n- Rosi Golan's songs have been featured in the films \"Dear John\" and \"Tiger Eyes\".\n- Rosi Golan's songs have been featured in the TV shows \"Vampire Diaries\", \"Grey's Anatomy\", \"Private Practice\", \"Brothers & Sisters\", \"One Tree Hill\", and \"Ghost Whisperer\".\n- Rosi Golan's songs have been used in commercials for Chicco, Pantene, J. C. Penney, and Walmart.\n- \"Bee\" is a song recorded by Lena Meyer-Landrut and Jennifer Braun.\n- Rosi Golan, Mayaeni Strauss, and Per Kristian Ottestad composed the song \"Bee\".",
